section B bars=16
// bars 1-8: the accordion sings in threes against the bass's twos
accordion   | !mf D5q C5q Bb4q | C5q Bb4q A4q | Bb4q A4q G4q | G4e A4e Bb4e C5q. | D5q C5q Bb4q | C5q Bb4q A4q | D5e E5e F5e A5q. | B5q. G5e F5e D5e |
flute       | R | R | R | R | R | R | R | R |
